 checks. Continue the next unfinished action.\nAll writes and tests must use these tools.\nos and pathlib are unavailable in action code; use file/command tools. Import allowed modules before using them.\nWhen calling write_note, include its complete exact content in the prose before the code and pass the same text as one content string literal.\nRead all three files with read_file first, then read/reuse complete mechanisms from all three\nbefore the first edit. Source notes are OPTIONAL; current source blocks can be used directly.\nWhen progress says phase=edit, the initial reading and baseline are satisfied. Apply a scoped edit and verify.\nA note may replace original text only after its mechanisms were exposed. Do not repeat full reads to register them again.\n\nCurrent plan; retain these exact titles and order, update status only:\n[{\"title\": \"check protocol\", \"status\": \"doing\"}]\nCourse progress before this request (evidence offered below may satisfy pending items after delivery):\n{\"phase\":\"finish_plan\",\"next_requirement\":\"Current files are verified. Call final_answer to complete the plan and finish.\",\"remaining_count\":1,\"requests_left\":6,\"baseline_done\":1,\"changed_files\":[],\"verified_current\":1,\"required_checks\":1,\"request_number\":2,\"max_requests\":8,\"requests_after_response\":6,\"first_write_reading_required\":true,\"full_reads_registered\":{},\"evidence_delivery\":\"Registered full reads are logged tool reads; Evidence headers show selected ranges, whose delivery requires HTTP confirmation.\",\"required_mechanisms_exposed\":{}}"}]}, {"role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "```python\nupdate_plan(items=[{'title':'check protocol','status':'doing'}])\nrun_command(argv=['python','-m','pytest','-q'])\nvalue=41\n```"}]}, {"role": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Latest execution feedback:\nExecutor output:\nExecution logs:\nLast output from code snippet:\n41\nRecent project tool results:\n[{\"tool\":